[
  {
    "screen": 1,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "秦始皇陵的兵马俑都挖出来",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 2,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "几十年了，",
    "chars": 5
  },
  {
    "screen": 3,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "可真正的地宫——",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 4,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "秦始皇安葬的地方，",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 5,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "到今天也没打开。",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 6,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "为什么？",
    "chars": 4
  },
  {
    "screen": 7,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "不是挖不动。",
    "chars": 6
  },
  {
    "screen": 8,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "头一个原因，是怕护不住。",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 9,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "兵马俑刚出土时，",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 10,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "身上的颜色见了空气没多久就",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 11,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "脱落了，",
    "chars": 4
  },
  {
    "screen": 12,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这个教训太深：",
    "chars": 7
  },
  {
    "screen": 13,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "地宫里若有竹简、漆器，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 14,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "一打开，可能就来不及护。",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 15,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "第二个原因，史书里写过，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 16,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "地宫里以水银做江河湖海；",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 17,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "后来的探测也确实发现，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 18,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "封土一带有汞含量异常的地方，",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 19,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "和记载能对上几分——",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 20,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "但地宫里到底是什么样，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 21,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "凭这个还下不了结论。",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 22,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "在保护的把握没备足之前，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 23,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "专家宁可让它在地下再等些年。",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 24,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "开挖是本事，忍住不开，",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 25,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "是更大的本事。",
    "chars": 7
  },
  {
    "screen": 26,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这份克制，是留给后人的。",
    "chars": 12
  }
]